      </comment>
     </target>
     <actual value="1816353.00">
      <comment>
       <narrative xml:lang="EN">Approximately 1,816,353 sheep and goats received vaccination services against Peste des Petits Ruminants (PPR) to benefit 45,409HH(272,454 people) from the 5,120,000 total number of animals expected to be vaccinated with WB funds.</narrative>
      </comment>
     </actual>
    </period>
   </indicator>
